# Slot in: translations/<lang>/LC_MESSAGES/flipflop.po (see build.rs). The msgids are
# the English source strings, as written in @tr(...) in src/ui/*.slint and in
# i18n::tr(...)/i18n::tr_args(...)/i18n::trn(...) in src/*.rs; `{}` and `{n}` are the
# placeholders those calls fill in. The catalog is compiled in: no files are shipped
# next to the binary, and the language is picked in Settings or from the system locale.
